# Engram footprint manifests: script-generated, content-addressed sidecars.
# -text: never CRLF-translate (they are byte-compared against git ls-tree output).
# -diff: treat as binary in diffs (regenerate via engram-manifest; don't read diffs).
# merge=binary: force a conflict on merge -- resolve by REGENERATING via
# engram-manifest update, never by taking both sides (post-merge cards read as
# DRIFTED until /mem-sync re-attests anyway).
atlas/*.manifest -text -diff merge=binary
